INTERVIEW TRAP QUESTIONS
======================================================================

Q1. Is the biggest benefit of CI/CD automatic deployment?

Answer

No.

The overall benefit is faster, reliable, and high-quality software
delivery through automation and continuous feedback.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q2. Does CI/CD eliminate software bugs?

Answer

No.

CI/CD helps detect bugs earlier, but it cannot guarantee bug-free
software.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q3. Does CI/CD replace developers or testers?

Answer

No.

CI/CD automates repetitive tasks, but developers and testers are still
responsible for writing quality code and effective test cases.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q4. Why does CI/CD reduce deployment risk?

Answer

Because software is built, tested, and released in small, incremental
changes instead of large releases, making failures easier to detect and
recover from.

